source_location=/tmp/claude-1000/-home-debian-rurema/3717a77b-67d6-4a40-b15e-a41ca141ab34/scratchpad/frozen.ZtgaSH/src/refm/api/src/yaml/YAML.inside

--- detect_implicit(val) -> String

タグを省略した値の型を判定します。

@param val 判定される文字列を指定します。

  require 'yaml'
  
  p YAML.detect_implicit("")
  # => "null"
  p YAML.detect_implicit("Cat")
  # => "str"
  p YAML.detect_implicit("true")
  # => "bool#yes"
  p YAML.detect_implicit("10")
  # => "int"
  p YAML.detect_implicit("0x10")
  # => "int#hex"

